+	<!-- advc.004m: 2200 in BtS.
+		 Determines the camera distance at the start of a new game and after
+		 loading from a savegame, but also affects zoom sensitivity and
+		 the shifts between leader music, era music and ambient sounds.
+		 A lower value results in more fine-grained zoom levels and requires
+		 the player to zoom in farther to hear the leader music.
